<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><document id="167014" schemaversion="1.4" date="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" version="current" level="processed" position="1" publicationid="ebl1-syst-port-3u4v"><documentinfo><uri id="167014" external="false" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" created="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" modified="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" scheme="http" host="pr.localhost" port="80" path="/ps/epub/local1/documents/system_report/components/system_report-04.psml" decodedpath="/ps/epub/local1/documents/system_report/components/system_report-04.psml" title="Document Overview"><displaytitle>Document Overview</displaytitle></uri><reversexrefs><reversexref uriid="167013" href="../system_report.psml" frag="content" urititle="System Report" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" documenttype="references" id="719618" title="" type="none" forwardtype="embed" forwardtitle="Document Overview" forwarddisplay="document" forwardfrag="default" level="1"/></reversexrefs></documentinfo><fragmentinfo structure-modified="2019-09-10T11:43:43+10:00"><locator id="245900" fragment="167014-1" modified="2021-09-13T17:13:24+10:00"/><locator id="245902" fragment="167014-2" modified="2021-09-13T17:13:24+10:00"/><locator fragment="167014-1-1" modified="2019-09-13T13:55:55+10:00"/></fragmentinfo><metadata/><section id="167014-title"><fragment id="167014-title"><heading level="1" numbered="true" prefix="1.2" id="167014-1-title-1">Document Overview</heading></fragment></section><section id="167014-body"><fragment id="167014-1-1"><para>The System Report (<xref href="definitions.psml" uriid="167002" frag="default" type="none" config="definition" documenttype="glossary" display="manual" title="SR">SR</xref>) describes the external behavior of the application or subsystem identified. It also describes <xref href="definitions.psml" uriid="166978" frag="default" type="none" config="definition" documenttype="glossary" display="manual" title="Non-functional">Non-functional</xref> requirements, design constraints and other factors necessary to provide a complete and comprehensive description of the requirements for the software. The detailed behavior is described in the <inline label="definition">System Requirements</inline>.</para><para>This Section shall list by document number and title all documents referenced in this plan.</para><para>It is recommended to assign each document listed in this paragraph with a local reference to the SR by means of a number between square brackets for ease of reference in the document.</para><list><item>The problems that the system will solve.</item><item>cost-benefit analysis of creating the system application.</item><item>The business needs that the system will address.</item></list></fragment><fragment id="167014-1"><para><image src="diagram1.jpg" uriid="167033" width="300" height="180"/></para><block label="figure-caption">
<para indent="1" numbered="true" prefix="Fig 1-A">Components</para>
</block></fragment><fragment id="167014-2"><para><image src="diagram2.jpg" uriid="167031" width="200" height="332" alt="diagram2.jpg"/></para><block label="figure-caption">
<para indent="1" numbered="true" prefix="Fig 1-B">More components</para>
</block></fragment></section></document>